SECTION 3 — TIER 1: EACH ARM, EACH ERA, ON PAIRED FILLS (tail first). Deltas are arm - live_actual.
========================================================================================================
  Units: R_cap = capped-dollar R (the decision unit) · R_own = the arm's own realized R · pct = realized % · adr = P&L in ADR units.
  Sets: P_all = paired fills where the arm is settled or a book no-entry; P_cap = P_all minus rcap_uncomputable (R_cap metrics, readable count);
        P_own = P_all minus no-entry (R_own deltas). Tie = |delta| <= 0.05.

